{"created_at": "2026-11-22", "note": "一口の非共有と共食の形式という構図を、時刻の一致として読み直した。", "read_id": "READ-20261122-0db35b", "reading": "interpreted", "session_id": "SESSION-20261122-11b1d3", "target": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-dee886", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-11-22", "note": "満腹と空腹が同じ卓に並ぶ場面を、量の分配ではなく待ち合わせの指示として読んだ。", "read_id": "READ-20261122-9afc5c", "reading": "interpreted", "session_id": "SESSION-20261122-11b1d3", "target": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-c514ef", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-11-22", "note": "落ち穂の幅を決める者が畑の持ち主である点を、分配の予知の側から読んだ。", "read_id": "READ-20261122-6e078b", "reading": "interpreted", "session_id": "SESSION-20261122-11b1d3", "target": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-651323", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-11-22", "note": "三心と味見の位置を、空腹を満たさない行為という一点に絞って読んだ。", "read_id": "READ-20261122-7f7978", "reading": "interpreted", "session_id": "SESSION-20261122-11b1d3", "target": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-47df28", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-11-22", "note": "余りではなく口のパンを渡す責任を、公開が渡しているものの判定に使った。", "read_id": "READ-20261122-5a1579", "reading": "interpreted", "session_id": "SESSION-20261122-11b1d3", "target": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-c6108b", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-11-22", "note": "見えにくく遅れて現れるデータ作業を、鍋の大きさを夜のうちに決める手続きへ移して読んだ。", "read_id": "READ-20261122-c678b9", "reading": "interpreted", "session_id": "SESSION-20261122-11b1d3", "target": {"id": "MAT-20261024-38458f", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-11-22", "note": "蓄えるほど腐るという規則を、腐らない要約と腐る読者という順序の逆転として読み直した。", "read_id": "READ-20261122-1234ac", "reading": "reinterpreted", "session_id": "SESSION-20261122-11b1d3", "target": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-c82bec", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-11-22", "note": "端として記述されることで場所になるという論点だけを文脈に置き、本文では使わなかった。", "read_id": "READ-20261122-ce3d24", "reading": "used_as_context", "session_id": "SESSION-20261122-11b1d3", "target": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-80686f", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-11-22", "note": "味覚を社交と記憶の交点として扱う見方は今回の論点とずれるため、読んだが使わなかった。", "read_id": "READ-20261122-703a3d", "reading": "used_as_context", "session_id": "SESSION-20261122-11b1d3", "target": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-8bc635", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-11-22", "note": "過剰な饗応の前で食欲が失われる構図は、薄めた椀の主題と重ならないため使わなかった。", "read_id": "READ-20261122-52ae7c", "reading": "used_as_context", "session_id": "SESSION-20261122-11b1d3", "target": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-574f7f", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-11-22", "note": "2026-10-24時点の46編監査（食事の動作0回/0編）を、今回179編で再測して比べた。", "read_id": "READ-20261122-663440", "reading": "counted", "session_id": "SESSION-20261122-11b1d3", "target": {"id": "MAT-20261024-9348f6", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-11-22", "note": "黒板に書かれない三つ（人数・塩・味見）を、書いてしまう側から読み直した。", "read_id": "READ-20261122-a2cd71", "reading": "reinterpreted", "session_id": "SESSION-20261122-11b1d3", "target": {"id": "FRAG-20261114-488074", "type": "fragment"}}
{"created_at": "2026-11-22", "note": "行程で量を変える配り方を、全員に同じだけ薄める配り方から異議として読んだ。", "read_id": "READ-20261122-a16b95", "reading": "contested", "session_id": "SESSION-20261122-11b1d3", "target": {"id": "FRAG-20261113-649179", "type": "fragment"}}
{"created_at": "2026-11-22", "note": "歌わない選択を拒否の形式として読んだが、今回は空腹と分配の軸に絞ったため使わなかった。", "read_id": "READ-20261122-45f074", "reading": "used_as_context", "session_id": "SESSION-20261122-11b1d3", "target": {"id": "FRAG-20261028-c158fb", "type": "fragment"}}
{"created_at": "2026-11-22", "note": "発酵と保存の対比を、同じ台所の語彙を使う前の重複確認として読んだ。", "read_id": "READ-20261122-8eec6b", "reading": "used_as_context", "session_id": "SESSION-20261122-11b1d3", "target": {"id": "FRAG-20261026-b73a9a", "type": "fragment"}}
{"created_at": "2026-11-22", "note": "要約は腐らないが血肉にもならないという一句を、順序の逆転として読み直した。", "read_id": "READ-20261122-2f6db0", "reading": "reinterpreted", "session_id": "SESSION-20261122-11b1d3", "target": {"id": "FRAG-20261024-aa85d2", "type": "fragment"}}
{"created_at": "2026-11-22", "note": "誰が調理し誰が検証し誰が読む時間を持てないのかという問いを、鍋の大きさと味見の位置へ置き直した。", "read_id": "READ-20261122-d7ec7e", "reading": "reinterpreted", "session_id": "SESSION-20261122-11b1d3", "target": {"id": "Q-20261024-b23994", "type": "question"}}
{"created_at": "2026-11-22", "note": "手は働かないという系譜を、味見という労働の形で受け取った。", "read_id": "READ-20261122-e04ebb", "reading": "interpreted", "session_id": "SESSION-20261122-11b1d3", "target": {"id": "Q-062", "type": "question"}}
{"created_at": "2026-11-22", "note": "資料の背後にある見えない手の労働という系譜を、夜のうちの炊き出しの作業に重ねた。", "read_id": "READ-20261122-2a180a", "reading": "interpreted", "session_id": "SESSION-20261122-11b1d3", "target": {"id": "Q-065", "type": "question"}}
{"created_at": "2026-11-22", "note": "声の収束を問う系譜を、今回は分配の軸と交差させず文脈に留めた。", "read_id": "READ-20261122-d88a26", "reading": "used_as_context", "session_id": "SESSION-20261122-11b1d3", "target": {"id": "Q-011", "type": "question"}}
{"created_at": "2026-11-22", "note": "食べること・飢えることの糸が、分配の時刻と味見の位置をまだ持っていないことを確かめた。", "read_id": "READ-20261122-6107bd", "reading": "interpreted", "session_id": "SESSION-20261122-11b1d3", "target": {"id": "MOTIF-20261024-71b589", "type": "motif"}}
{"created_at": "2026-11-22", "note": "労働と負債の糸を、残せるのは道具ではなく借りだという一句で受け取った。", "read_id": "READ-20261122-0d0569", "reading": "interpreted", "session_id": "SESSION-20261122-11b1d3", "target": {"id": "MOTIF-012", "type": "motif"}}
